      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Skype doesn&#39;t have to have video...I mean, it [i]can[/i], but I&#39;ve never personally used it (though I&#39;ve chatted to my sister when she was working in Egypt and had a webcam). I just text chat to people, generally, except for my partner whom I voice chat with every night (well, nearly - tonight is an extremely rare exception as he&#39;s working a night shift and would&#39;ve already left for that by the time I got home from work :(), because he&#39;s not very fast at typing and also because we game together a lot and voice chat makes things so much easier :).\n\nI did have Teamspeak on my old computer when I was part of a gaming group but only used it a couple of times.\n\nI didn&#39;t know Steam had actual multiple-person chat. So far I&#39;ve only ever used it to chat to the very few people in my friends list. I&#39;m not even sure if it has audio chat (but probably - most such chat features seem to have audio now, though I&#39;m not fussed about using it unless I&#39;m gaming with someone).\n",
